  "Change the password for a local administrator account.\n\nIf no local administrator has been configured yet, this\noption lets you set up an initial admin or root account.\n\nNote: changing a password will disable two-factor\nauthentication for that account.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Badilisha nenosiri la akaunti ya msimamizi wa ndani.\n\nIkiwa bado hakuna msimamizi wa ndani ambaye amesanidiwa, hii\nchaguo hukuruhusu kusanidi msimamizi wa awali au akaunti ya mizizi.\n\nKumbuka: kubadilisha nenosiri kutalemaza sababu mbili\nuthibitishaji wa akaunti hiyo."
  },
  "Changes applied. Network will roll back in ~60 seconds\nunless you press [p] to persist them.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Mabadiliko yametumika. Mtandao utarejeshwa baada ya ~ sekunde 60\nisipokuwa ukibonyeza [p] kuyashikilia."
  },
  "Changes applied. Press [p] to persist or they roll back in {n}s.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Mabadiliko yametumika. Bonyeza [p] ili kuendelea au zitarudi nyuma baada ya {n}s."
  },
