  "Configuration reset initiated.\nThe system will reboot with default settings.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Uwekaji upya wa usanidi umeanzishwa.\nMfumo utaanza upya na mipangilio chaguo-msingi."
  },
  "Configure global network settings:\n\n  • Hostname and domain\n  • Default IPv4 and IPv6 gateways\n  • DNS nameservers (up to three)\n\nChanges take effect immediately after saving.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Sanidi mipangilio ya mtandao wa kimataifa:\n\n  • Jina la mwenyeji na kikoa\n  • Lango chaguomsingi la IPv4 na IPv6\n  • seva za majina za DNS (hadi tatu)\n\nMabadiliko huanza kutumika mara tu baada ya kuhifadhi."
  },
