  "Configure network settings": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Sanidi mipangilio ya mtandao"
  },
  "Configure networking for this TrueNAS system.\n\n  • Interface settings  – DHCP, IP aliases, MTU\n  • Network settings    – Hostname, domain, gateways, DNS\n  • Static routes       – Add and remove static routes\n\nChanges to interfaces require a commit step\nbefore they take effect.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Sanidi mtandao wa mfumo huu wa TrueNAS.\n\n  • Mipangilio ya kiolesura – DHCP, lakabu za IP, MTU\n  • Mipangilio ya mtandao – Jina la mpangishi, kikoa, lango, DNS\n  • Njia tuli - Ongeza na uondoe njia tuli\n\nMabadiliko ya violesura yanahitaji hatua ya kujitolea\nkabla hazijaanza kutumika."
  },
